[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_5A_CRYSTAL]
Crystal Lance

[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_5A_CRYSTAL_desc]
Although it is said that diamond dogs themselves do not often use this kind of ammunition, they always work hard to promote the advantages of this kind of ammunition to various countries.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_5A_CRYSTAL]
水晶标枪

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_5A_CRYSTAL_desc]
虽然听说钻石狗们自己不常用这种炮弹，但是他们总是向各国卖力的宣传这种炮弹的优点。
